#: kutils/kfinddialog.cpp:256
msgid ""
"<qt>If enabled, any occurrence of <code><b>\\N</b></code>, where <code><b>N</b>"
"</code> is a integer number, will be replaced with the corresponding capture "
"(\"parenthesized substring\") from the pattern."
"<p>To include (a literal <code><b>\\N</b></code> in your replacement, put an "
"extra backslash in front of it, like <code><b>\\\\N</b></code>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>यदि सक्षम पारिएमा,<code><b>\\N</b></code>को कुनै घटना, जहाँ <code><b>N</b>"
"</code> एउटा इन्टिजर सङ्ख्या हुन्छ, त्यसलाई बान्कीबाट अनुकूल समातिएको "
"(\"parenthesized substring\") सँग बदलिन्छ ।"
"<p>तपाईँले प्रतिस्थापनमा समावेश गर्न (अक्षरश <code><b>\\N</b></code>"
